# Mediawiki get-code

Can be used to retrieve code easily from Gerrit.

You can persist some configurable settings in the config.

```sh
mw config get gerrit.username
mw config set gerrit.username foo
```

New Gerrit clones receive Wikimedia Gerrit's official `commit-msg` hook, including
when cloning from a GitHub mirror before switching the remote to Gerrit. This adds
Change-Id trailers when you commit. Existing hooks and any configured
`core.hooksPath` are preserved.


Use `--jobs 4` (or `-j 4`) to clone up to four independent skins/extensions at a
time. Core is always cloned first. The default is one job.